1
00:05:56,842 --> 00:06:02,842
A crash course in revenge.

2
00:11:53,684 --> 00:11:59,684
Death Proof is a action, thriller film directed by Quentin Tarantino.

3
00:17:50,526 --> 00:17:56,526
Austin's hottest DJ, Jungle Julia, sets out into the night to
unwind with her two friends Shanna and Arlene.

4
00:23:47,368 --> 00:23:53,368
Covertly tracking their moves is Stuntman Mike, a scarred rebel leering from
behind the wheel of his muscle car, revving just feet away.

5
00:29:44,210 --> 00:29:50,210
Stuntman Mike, played by Kurt Russell.

6
00:35:41,052 --> 00:35:47,052
Zoë Bell, played by Zoë Bell.

7
00:41:37,894 --> 00:41:43,894
Abernathy, played by Rosario Dawson.

8
00:47:34,736 --> 00:47:40,736
Arlene, played by Vanessa Ferlito.

9
00:53:31,578 --> 00:53:37,578
Jungle Julia, played by Sydney Tamiia Poitier.

10
00:59:28,421 --> 00:59:34,421
Kim, played by Tracie Thoms.

11
01:05:25,263 --> 01:05:31,263
Death Proof is a 2007 American slasher film written,
co-produced, shot and directed by Quentin Tarantino.

12
01:11:22,105 --> 01:11:28,105
It stars Kurt Russell as a stuntman who murders young women
with modified cars he describes as "death-proof".

13
01:17:18,947 --> 01:17:24,947
Rosario Dawson, Vanessa Ferlito, Jordan Ladd, Rose McGowan, Sydney Tamiia Poitier, Tracie
Thoms, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, and Zoë Bell co-star as the women he targets.

14
01:23:15,789 --> 01:23:21,789
The film was originally released theatrically as part of Grindhouse, a double
feature that combined Death Proof with Robert Rodriguez's Planet Terror.

15
01:29:12,631 --> 01:29:18,631
After Grindhouse underperformed at the domestic box office, Death Proof was
released as a standalone feature in other countries and on home media.

16
01:35:09,473 --> 01:35:15,473
It received mostly positive reviews for its stunt sequences and tribute to
exploitation cinema, although its pacing was criticized.

17
01:41:06,315 --> 01:41:12,315
The film explores themes of sports car, sadism,
psychopath, disc jockey, ladykiller.

18
01:47:03,157 --> 01:47:09,157
The tone is intense.
